## WHEN TO CHECK

**Check for old format cap statements when:**
1. User says "send" or "email" for any bid — check the cap statement BEFORE presenting
2. User opens or references a bid folder — check if cap statement exists and is v3
3. User asks to "update" or "refresh" a cap statement — always regenerate as v3
4. Generating a new outreach package — always use v3 engine
5. User references the master cap statement PDF — this IS the v3 standard

